#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * DeepSeek Harness Multi-Agent Delegation Runner for Antigravity & OpenCode
 *
 * Integrates Antigravity / OpenCode as Lead Supervisor with Real External
 * DeepSeek Harness Agent Sessions.
 *
 * Terminology Standard:
 * - Antigravity: Lead Supervisor & Orchestrator
 * - ECC: Engineering discipline, skills & verification layer
 * - DeepSeek Harness: External multi-agent execution layer
 * - IDs generated by this runner: ORCHESTRATION RUN ID
 * - Read-only modes without tool/fs restriction: SOFT READ-ONLY (Prompt Enforced)
 * - Worktree write modes: WRITE / ISOLATED WORKTREE
 */

